<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 两个进展</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>DSH 的代价：市场没上线、治理自建、接口还在快变</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D"}}>价钱</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>这些不是缺陷，是「你拥有整个运行时」这件事本身的价格。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #1C1F23", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>01</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>官方插件市场还没上线</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>白名单与逐件审计，要自己建。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>02</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>接口还在快变</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>v0.1 阶段，二次开发量明显高于「引擎即用」那条路线。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #A32D2D", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>03</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>所以它的代价是：治理自建</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>好处是自由的价钱，不是免费的午餐。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>34 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
